    "description": "<blockquote><p><em><strong>Requirements: </strong>You must have mastered the <strong>Assassin</strong> class and acquired the <strong>Assassinate</strong> skill.</em></p></blockquote><p>Whenever you perform the <strong>Assassinate</strong> skill, choose one:</p><p>Target an additional creature; <strong>or</strong> repeat your <strong>Accuracy Check</strong> and keep the better result.</p><p>If both <strong>Accuracy Checks</strong> against the same target would have resulted in triggering an <em>Assassination</em>, increase the damage multiplier by one step (e.g from <strong>x2</strong> to <strong>x3</strong>, or <strong>x3</strong> to <strong>x4</strong>).</p>",
